From: OnePlus 13 mainline port
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom_scm: disable QSEECOM machine check for SM8750

The ABL bootloader overwrites the root compatible property, so the
QSEECOM machine allowlist never matches. Disable the check for
development. This enables PAS authentication for ADSP.

Signed-off-by: OnePlus 13 mainline port
---
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2354,9 +2354,7 @@
 
 	dev_info(scm->dev, "qseecom: found qseecom with version 0x%x\n", version);
 
-	if (!of_machine_device_match(qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist)) {
-		dev_info(scm->dev, "qseecom: untested machine, skipping\n");
-		return 0;
+	/* QSEECOM machine check disabled for SM8750 development: ABL overwrites
	 * the root compatible so the allowlist match fails. */
	if (false) { // !of_machine_device_match(qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist)) {
		dev_info(scm->dev, "qseecom: untested machine, skipping
");
		return 0;
	}
 	}
 
 	/*
